Allow OpenMRS 2.8.x through the dbsync version whitelist.

Upstream openmrs-dbsync 4.0.0 (and master, checked 2026-09-02) refuses to start
against any OpenMRS platform newer than 2.7: AppUtils.adjustJpaMappings() reads the
version from the REST systeminformation endpoint and throws for anything outside
its whitelist. LiberiaEMR pins platform 2.8.8 (distro.properties, ADR 0006).

The whitelist guards the JPA entity mappings. The openmrs-core liquibase changelog
for 2.8.x touches exactly one synced table: provider gains a nullable
provider_role_id column, which an unmapped JPA entity never selects. The other 2.8
changes (new provider_role table, a type widening on concept_reference_range) are
outside the synced set. The 2.7 mappings therefore remain structurally valid on
2.8.8, with one recorded fidelity gap: provider role assignments are not carried
in sync payloads until upstream maps them.

Verified end to end on 2026-09-02 against MariaDB 10.11 and platform 2.8.8: schema
snapshot, binlog attach, and correct payloads for a patient registration
(PatientModel, PersonNameModel, PatientIdentifierModel).

This is a deviation from the stock artefact and is flagged on LE-22 per the LE-35
scope rule. Modify+PR tracking, including the upstream PR that retires this patch,
lives in packages/modify-pr/.patches/0001-openmrs-dbsync-allow-openmrs-2.8.md
(whitelist is in api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/eip/dbsync/AppUtils.java).

diff --git a/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/eip/dbsync/AppUtils.java b/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/eip/dbsync/AppUtils.java
index 9b84123..c075fb0 100644
--- a/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/eip/dbsync/AppUtils.java
+++ b/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/eip/dbsync/AppUtils.java
@@ -64,7 +64,7 @@ public class AppUtils {
 			if (openmrsFullVersion.startsWith("2.5")) {
 				List<Class<? extends Annotation>> annotations = List.of(JoinColumn.class, ManyToOne.class);
 				SyncUtils.makeTransient("patientProgram", PatientIdentifier.class, annotations);
-			} else if (!openmrsFullVersion.startsWith("2.6") && !openmrsFullVersion.startsWith("2.7")) {
+			} else if (!openmrsFullVersion.startsWith("2.6") && !openmrsFullVersion.startsWith("2.7") && !openmrsFullVersion.startsWith("2.8")) {
 				final String openmrsVersion = StringUtils.split(openmrsFullVersion, " ")[0];
 				throw new EIPException("DB sync does not support OpenMRS version " + openmrsVersion);
 			}
